==English==

{{wikipedia}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[arithmetic]] [[progression]]}}

# {{context|analysis|lang=en}} A [[sequence]] in which each term except the first is obtained from the previous by adding a [[constant]] value, known as the [[common difference]] of the arithmetic progression.

